Error [jet.ReturnTypeMismatch]: This value is `Label`, but `make` returns Point
  --> tests/ui/static_trait_method_self_return_mismatch.jet:9:30
    |
  9 |         make: fn() -> Self { Label{text: "wrong"} }
    |                              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `make` declares Point as its result, so the value it hands back must be Point
 Fix: Hand back a Point value: convert this value to Point, or return the value you meant
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113
